//! conversion — eight `kernel_opt` own-rules from the Layr-Labs
//! cudafast-bonsai2-9b-engine fork's GB10 GDN serving lane, every quote
//! verbatim at its pin (local clone .raw/yukon-engine @ 36c9536, MIT).
//!
//! - `lane-permuted-column-reduce-same-butterfly-tree-bit-identity` (A) —
//!   the L8 lane→row remap: the same butterfly tree, 40 → 6 shuffles/token.
//! - `lazy-rollback-journaled-window-replay-replaces-eager-state-snapshots`
//!   (G) — journal + gated replay with the eager-slot fallback.
//! - `dead-destination-scale-elided-consumer-applies-on-load` (C) — the
